---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Leow Kah Man | Technology Executive & Engineering Leader"
  description="Executive background, leadership philosophy, and enterprise engineering track record of Leow Kah Man."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-14">
    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <header class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-10">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center sm:items-start gap-8">
        <div class="w-28 h-28 sm:w-32 sm:h-32 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 text-white flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-4xl tracking-tighter shadow-md border-2 border-brand-500/30">
          KM
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 text-center sm:text-left space-y-4">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-50 text-brand-700 dark:bg-brand-950 dark:text-brand-300 border border-brand-200/60 dark:border-brand-800/60">
            Technology Executive &amp; Engineering Leader
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white leading-tight">
            Leow Kah Man
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
            Transformational Technology Executive with 20+ years of enterprise engineering leadership. Aligning business strategy with scalable execution, directing platform squads and multi-million operating budgets, and pioneering AI-augmented software delivery.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Engineering Leadership & Philosophy -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 pb-3">
        Engineering Leadership &amp; Philosophy
      </h2>
      <div class="prose-tech space-y-4 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          With over two decades directing engineering teams across high-growth product ecosystems and mission-critical enterprise environments, my approach to technology leadership bridges executive business strategy with unyielding architectural discipline.
        </p>
        <p>
          Sustainable engineering organisations are not built on ephemeral technology trends. They are forged through <strong>engineering pragmatism</strong>: choosing maintainable primitives, reducing cognitive load across codebases, optimising cloud OPEX through disciplined FinOps, and ensuring systems degrade gracefully under failure.
        </p>
        <p>
          As an enterprise engineering leader, my focus spans four strategic pillars:
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Executive Pillars Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-2">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>
            Enterprise Modernisation &amp; Decoupling
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Leading cross-team squads in methodically transforming 10–20-year-old monolithic platforms into resilient, event-driven microservices. Grounded in TOGAF 9.1 governance and Domain-Driven Design (DDD) to eliminate systemic single points of failure.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>
            AI-Augmented SDLC &amp; Automation
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Pioneering autonomous AI execution harnesses and real-time AI architectural review pipelines. Embedding intelligent quality gates across the delivery lifecycle to accelerate velocity, eradicate architectural drift, and maintain production standards.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>
            Cloud FinOps &amp; Operational Resilience
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Architecting high-availability platforms across hybrid and multi-cloud environments (AWS, Azure, AliCloud). Standardising Kubernetes container orchestration, zero-downtime CI/CD pipelines, and aggressive infrastructure cost optimisation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-500"></span>
            High-Performance Org Design &amp; Governance
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Directing blended engineering organisations of up to 20 personnel (internal full-time staff and vendor partners) within multi-million operating budgets. Mentoring engineering managers and technical leads to cultivate engineering craftsmanship and accountability.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Leadership Track Record -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 pb-3">
        Executive Leadership Track Record
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <!-- Role 1 -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50/70 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1 mb-2">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              Principal Software Architect &amp; Technical Leader
            </h3>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 bg-brand-50 dark:bg-brand-950 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-brand-200/50 dark:border-brand-800/50 w-fit">
              Appspace &bull; Feb 2023 – Present
            </span>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 list-disc list-inside mt-3">
            <li>Architect and steer technical direction for 2 core platform engineering squads while serving as cross-team architectural advisor across broader product lines.</li>
            <li>Drive the systematic decoupling of 10–20-year-old monolithic platforms into resilient, scalable microservices, eliminating single points of failure and reducing cloud OPEX.</li>
            <li>Conceived and operationalised custom autonomous AI execution harnesses integrated directly into the engineering workflow to accelerate feature delivery while enforcing design consistency.</li>
            <li>Partnered with executive leadership to elevate application-level security controls to surpass enterprise audit and compliance benchmarks.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Role 2 -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50/70 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1 mb-2">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              Sr. AVP, Advertising Technology Lead
            </h3>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 w-fit">
              MEASAT Broadcast Network Systems (Astro) &bull; Feb 2022 – Feb 2023
            </span>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 list-disc list-inside mt-3">
            <li>Headed a combined engineering organisation of 20 personnel (8 internal engineers and 12+ external vendor engineers), managing delivery and staffing within an RM2M+ budget.</li>
            <li>Owned the technical architecture, delivery roadmap, and vendor contracts for enterprise ad management and financial tracking systems across commercial broadcast networks.</li>
            <li>Partnered with commercial and finance leaders to prioritise backlogs, resolve architectural bottlenecks, and maintain strict broadcast regulatory compliance.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Role 3 -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50/70 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1 mb-2">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              Solution Architect
            </h3>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 w-fit">
              Nettium &bull; Apr 2019 – Feb 2022
            </span>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 list-disc list-inside mt-3">
            <li>Spearheaded company-wide Kubernetes adoption across hybrid on-premise and multi-cloud environments (AWS EKS, AliCloud), establishing zero-downtime deployment pipelines.</li>
            <li>Accelerated developer release cadences by engineering automated CI/CD pipelines via Azure DevOps and multi-stage container builds.</li>
            <li>Mentored senior engineers and technical leads in Domain-Driven Design (DDD), .NET Core testing frameworks, and containerisation best practices.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Prior Roles Summary -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50/70 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1 mb-2">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              Software Architect &amp; Technical Delivery Lead
            </h3>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 w-fit">
              Experian &bull; Mar 2016 – Jan 2019
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-2">
            Led end-to-end technical delivery for a cross-functional engineering team of ~10 engineers, architecting scalable enterprise marketing data solutions and high-throughput data pipelines across distributed systems.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Education & Certifications -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 pb-3">
        Education &amp; Enterprise Governance
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 mb-1">
            Enterprise Certification
          </div>
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base">
            TOGAF 9.1 Certified
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">
            Level 1 &amp; Level 2 &bull; The Open Group
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-600 dark:dark:text-brand-400 mb-1">
            Postgraduate Degree
          </div>
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base">
            MSc in Information Technology
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">
            Malaysia University of Science and Technology
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
          <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 mb-1">
            Undergraduate Degree
          </div>
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base">
            BSc (Hons) in Computing
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">
            First Class Honours &bull; University of Greenwich / Sunway
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Connect / Executive Advisory Box (Soft Cream Styling, No GitHub) -->
    <section class="p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl bg-[#FAF7F2] dark:bg-slate-900 border border-amber-200/70 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="space-y-2 text-center md:text-left">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          Connect
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm max-w-lg leading-relaxed">
          For executive networking, technology advisory, or engineering leadership discussions, connect with me directly on LinkedIn.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kmleow"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-400"
        >
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current mr-2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.764s.784-1.764 1.75-1.764 1.75.79 1.75 1.764-.783 1.764-1.75 1.764zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z"/>
          </svg>
          LinkedIn
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>